# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# Fixed 60-second stress render: useful for comparative host audio studies.
# Load STRESS with SEL+REC and START THE SEQUENCE with SEL+PLAY.
# Warm up for 12 s, then record three 20-second pitch cycles.
# Hardware CPU0/CPU1 deadlines must be tested separately on actual FM-1.
notips
master 2458
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
expect par112 50
expect ghostmode 14
expect seqcount 4
expect seqtotal 20
tap PLAY
press SEL
tap PLAY
release SEL
expect seqstate 1
wait 12000
wav stress-60s.wav
wait 60000
wavstop
